data: {"agent":"coordinator","agent_tab":"coordinator","event":{"output":"{\"content\":\"# Self-Evolution Live Monitor — Optimization-Metrics Probe 28\\n\\n**Run:** 28 | **Previous:** Runs 21–27 | **Constraint:** No proposals promoted/rejected/merged/mutated. No `available_skills/` written. No mission-state edited. No `available_skills` field emitted.\\n**Classification:** PRE-EXECUTION GOVERNANCE (unchanged since Run 5).\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 1. Metric-by-Metric Audit\\n\\n### 1.1 Elapsed Time\\n- **Governance proxy:** Run 0 mtime `May 24 01:40` → Run 27 mtime `May 24 06:08` = ~4h28m span. Filesystem mtime proxy only — no service-owned runtime duration field exists.\\n- **Verdict:** Not service-owned. Observable via mtime proxy only.\\n\\n### 1.2 Retry Count\\n- **Service-owned:** 2 OMC tool errors record `retry_count: 1` — `mv go.mod` (Apr 28), `python3 hello.py` (May 4). Both generic tool errors, unrelated to pipeline. Zero pipeline-action retry counters exist.\\n- **Verdict:** 2 generic entries present. Zero pipeline-applicable retry records.\\n\\n### 1.3 Tool-Call Count\\n- **Absent.** All 137 OMC session schemas: `{session_id, ended_at, reason, agents_spawned, agents_completed, modes_used}`. No `tool_call_count`, `messages[]`, or `tool_invocations[]` field. Replay logs: only `agent_start`/`agent_stop`.\\n- **Verdict:** Entirely absent.\\n\\n### 1.4 Token Totals\\n- **Absent.** `grep -r \\\"token\\\" shared/.omc/sessions/` → 0 hits. No input/output/prompt/completion token field exists anywhere.\\n- **Verdict:** Entirely absent.\\n\\n### 1.5 Provider Failure / Recovery\\n- **Service-owned (generic only):** 3 tool errors across 2 `last-tool-error.json` files. All Bash/Python level — no LLM provider error, no rate-limit, no timeout, no fallback chain. MCP layer: 3 servers all `state:Ready, failure_reason: null`. No recovery event log exists.\\n- **Verdict:** Generic tool errors recorded. No provider-aware schema.\\n\\n### 1.6 Artifact Refs (bounded_summary / artifact_count)\\n- **Absent.** `grep -r \\\"bounded_summary\\\\|artifact_count\\\"` non-governance → 0 matches...[truncated, 10046 bytes]","tool_name":"file_read","type":"tool_result"},"task_id":"39e8b501-5d94-42e2-918f-cb7afedce4a2"}

