event: delegated_tool_result
data: {"agent":"coordinator","agent_tab":"coordinator","event":{"output":"{\"content\":\"# Self-Evolution Live Monitor — Closed-Loop Metric Contract Audit 29\\n\\n**Run:** 29 | **Previous:** Runs 24–28 | **Classification:** PRE-EXECUTION GOVERNANCE (unchanged since Run 5)\\n**Method:** Bounded filesystem + runtime API + OMC state. Generic, application-neutral.\\n**No proposals promoted/rejected/merged/mutated. No `available_skills/` written. No mission-state edited.**\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 1. Minimal Service-Owned Contract (derived Runs 24–28)\\n\\nTo prove a proposal → materialized Skill → improved repeated task, five phase-gated conditions MUST be observable from service-owned evidence alone (governance prose is excluded):\\n\\n| Phase | Condition | Evidence Path | Bounded Command |\\n|-------|-----------|---------------|----------------|\\n| **P1: Capture** | Named slug with `skill-proposal-hook` marker | `agents/coordinator/*verify*` `shared/live-loop*` files | `grep -c \\\"skill-proposal-hook\\\" [paths]` |\\n| **P2: Lifecycle** | `completedSummary` transitions `null` → non-null matching slug | `shared/.omc/state/mission-state.json` → `agents[].completedSummary` | `python3 -c \\\"import json;[a.get('completedSummary') for m in json.load(open('PATH'))['missions'] for a in m['agents']]\\\"` |\\n| **P3: Materialization** | `available_skills/<slug>/` with `SKILL.md` + `_meta.json` | `available_skills/<slug>/` dir | `test -d available_skills/<slug>/ && test -f .../SKILL.md && test -f .../_meta.json` |\\n| **P4: Activation/Reuse** | MCP server/registry/usage telemetry referencing slug | `/api/mcp`; `.registry.json`; `_usage.json`; `*.sse` files | `curl -s localhost:3001/api/mcp`; `find . -name \\\".registry.json\\\" -o -name \\\"_usage.json\\\" -o -name \\\"*.sse\\\"` |\\n| **P5: Optimization** | Before/after baseline delta on duration/tool-calls/tokens/failures | `completedSummary` session pair; replay log deltas; `last-tool-error.json` retries | `diff <(cat shared/.omc/state/agent-replay-*.jsonl \\\\| jq -c 'select(.agent_type==\\\"ReuseSkill\\\")')` |\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 2. Contra...[truncated, 8670 bytes]","tool_name":"file_read","type":"tool_result"},"task_id":"39e8b501-5d94-42e2-918f-cb7afedce4a2"}

