data: {"agent":"coordinator","agent_tab":"coordinator","event":{"output":"{\"content\":\"# Self-Evolution Live Monitor — Reusability Probe 32\\n\\n**Run:** 32 | **Previous:** Run 31 (app_scoped_backlog_routing) | **Next:** Run 33  \\n**Method:** Bounded filesystem + ops API snapshots + cross-app comparison. Generic, application-neutral.  \\n**Constraint:** No proposals promoted/rejected/merged/mutated. No `available_skills/` modified. No mission-state edited.  \\n**Core question:** Is measurable Skill reuse or activation observed after repeated proposals, comparing platform-wide vs app-scoped proposal data for the last 24h?\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 1. Proposed Action — Current Landscape\\n\\n| Metric | Run 31 | Run 32 | Δ |\\n|--------|--------|--------|---|\\n| Governance `.md` artifacts (`shared/self_evolution_*.md`) | 30 | **31** | **+1** |\\n| Governance total lines | 5,831 | **5,978** | **+147** |\\n| Verification artifacts (triple-marker) | 6 | **6** | 0 |\\n| Verification artifacts with `skill-proposal-hook` | 4 | **5** | +1 (live-loop-10 lost hook) |\\n| Named unique proposal slug (instant-verify-marker) | 1 | **1** | 0 |\\n| `proposal_latest.md` / `trace.log` / `audit/` | MISSING | **MISSING** | 0 |\\n\\n**Governance grows linearly (+1 file, +147 lines). No operational pipeline artifacts created.**\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 2. Classification — All Proposals Are \\\"ReusableProcedure\\\"\\n\\n**Platform-wide (all apps):**\\n- Total proposals: **2,382** (up from 2,378 at Run 31, Δ +4)\\n- Classification `ReusableProcedure`: **2,382 (100%)**\\n- Lifecycle `Draft`: **2,382 (100%)**\\n- `recommended_action: CreateDraft`: **2,382 (100%)**\\n- `target_skill_name: None`: **2,382 (100%)**\\n- `destination: NewSkillDraft`: **2,382 (100%)**\\n- `reusable_procedure` text: **identical** across all 2,382 proposals\\n\\n**App-scoped (workspace `a9435a4b`):**\\n- Proposals: **26** (up from 23 at Run 29, plateaued at 26 since Run 31)\\n- Classification `ReusableProcedure`: **26 (100%)**\\n- Lifecycle `Draft`: **26 (100%)**\\n- `target_skill_name: None`: **26 (100%)**\\n- `destination: NewSkillDraft`: ...[truncated, 14992 bytes]","tool_name":"file_read","type":"tool_result"},"task_id":"39e8b501-5d94-42e2-918f-cb7afedce4a2"}

