data: {"agent":"coordinator","agent_tab":"coordinator","event":{"output":"{\"cwd\":\"/Users/quantum/.macaca/workspaces/a9435a4b-d123-5a4c-b0b7-d9b1342089ea\",\"exit_code\":0,\"stderr\":\"\",\"stdout\":\"=== telemetry_optimization SKILL.md ===\\n---\\nname: telemetry-optimization\\ndescription: \\\"Use when a future task needs the governed reusable procedure for telemetry-optimization; rely on linked evidence refs, registry visibility, telemetry, curation, approval, and rollback before reuse.\\\"\\n---\\n\\n# telemetry-optimization\\n\\n## When To Use\\nUse this skill when a future task matches this bounded procedure: Use linked event-log and Agent Execution trace refs to repeat tasks involving telemetry, optimization. Keep the generated Skill concise, trigger-oriented, proposal-linked, registry-visible, telemetry-audited, and governed by approval, rollb\\n\\n## Procedure\\nUse linked event-log and Agent Execution trace refs to repeat tasks involving telemetry, optimization. Keep the generated Skill concise, trigger-oriented, proposal-linked, registry-visible, telemetry-audited, and governed by approval, rollback, and sanitized evidence gates.\\n\\n## Verification\\n- Confirm terminal task evidence is still present before relying on this skill.\\n- Record new evidence refs when the procedure changes.\\n\\n## Provenance\\n- Proposal ref: `skill-exp-fc228e0f-b80c-4ca2-9c5b-955da3bdf811-1779721847001460000`\\n- Task ref: `fc228e0f-b80c-4ca2-9c5b-955da3bdf811`\\n- Trace ref: `skill-self-evolution:a9435a4b-d123-5a4c-b0b7-d9b1342089ea:132c5017-d5f3-4ebd-92a0-1471a17eeb8d:coordinator:fc228e0f-b80c-4ca2-9c5b-955da3bdf811`\\n=== materialization_activation_telemetry_registry SKILL.md ===\\n---\\nname: materialization-activation-telemetry-registry\\ndescription: \\\"Use when a future task needs the governed reusable procedure for materialization-activation-telemetry-registry; rely on linked evidence refs, registry visibility, telemetry, curation, approval, and rollback before reuse.\\\"\\n---\\n\\n# materialization-activation-telemetry-registry\\n\\n## When To Use\\nUse this skill when a future task m...[truncated, 3266 bytes]","tool_name":"shell","type":"tool_result"},"task_id":"39e8b501-5d94-42e2-918f-cb7afedce4a2"}

